WEBVTT
X-TIMESTAMP-MAP=LOCAL:00:00:00.000,MPEGTS:0

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:09.390
Le vidiyo ichaza indlela yokusebenzisa i-Arclight ukwenza i-fundal reflex ebomvu ngokukhetha isilungiselelo sokukhanya esigqame kakhulu.

2
00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:16.650
Qinisekisa ukuthi i-lens rack iphezulu, lapho kungekho khona amandla e-lens embobeni yokubona.

3
00:00:16.970 --> 00:00:22.010
Ebudeni bengalo, bheka i-reflex kuwo womabili amehlo ngesikhathi esisodwa.

4
00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:26.750
Qhathanisa ukukhanya nombala phakathi kwamehlo amabili.

5
00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:35.290
Ekuhloleni okuvamile, akufanele kube khona umehluko ophelele ekukhanyeni nasembalani phakathi kwamehlo amabili.

6
00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:42.120
Ezinganeni ezimhlophe nase-Asia, i-reflex ingabukeka i-orange futhi iphuzi.

7
00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:50.500
Lokhu kubukeka kusejwayelekile njengoba umbala nokukhanya kuyafana phakathi kwamehlo amabili.

8
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:58.980
I-reflex engavamile yilapho kunomehluko oqhubekayo, wangempela ekukhanyeni nasembalani phakathi kwamehlo amabili.

9
00:00:59.380 --> 00:01:10.890
Lokhu kungase kube ukuboniswa kwekhoneal okususiwe, indawo emnyama ekhona ngaphakathi kwe-reflex yeso elilodwa noma womabili amehlo, noma i-reflex ebomvu engekho nhlobo.

10
00:01:12.570 --> 00:01:25.670
Ukuhlolwa kwe-reflex okungavamile kungabonisa ukuba khona kwe-cataract, i-retinoblastoma, isibazi se-corneal, i-squint, noma iphutha lokubukeka.

11
00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:29.970
Konke lokhu kudinga ukuhlolwa okwengeziwe ngochwepheshe.
